('awin-trophycentral-custom-color-badges-80917-41923028110','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Color Badges","6.19","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923028110&a=2893129&m=80917","Create your own custom name badges using the options below. If you have a logo, please send it to sales@trophycentral.com. All artwork should be 600 DPI or higher (website artwork is only 75 DPI and unusable). Please use the Special Engraving Instructions Section on the shipping page to specify names, etc. We recommend no more than 16 characters per line for the 2\" wide size, 20 for the 3\" and 24 for the 4\" size."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-custom-color-badges-setup-charge-for-name-badge-80917-41923029929','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Color Badges: Setup Charge For Name Badge","35","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923029929&a=2893129&m=80917","Setup charge required for logo orders (one per logo). please send logo to sales@trophycentral.com. * Multi-Color Logo/Artwork may require pre-approval"]'),
('awin-trophycentral-custom-economy-school-medal-80917-41923027010','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Economy School Medal","3.49","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027010&a=2893129&m=80917","Custom 1 1/2\" gold economy medal (light-weight). Ribbon (30\" x 7/8\"), school imprint and subject imprint are included in price!"]'),
('awin-trophycentral-custom-embossers-80917-41923027397','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Embossers","56.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027397&a=2893129&m=80917","High quality heavy duty desk embossers include die plate. Extra die plates available for different imprints. Custom outer circle wording plus inner circle wording or stock logo (cannot have both inner circle wording and logo - logo pictures below). Click here for logo pictures. For the most attractive and legible imprint, we recommend that the number of characters be limited - outer circle maximum 45, inner circle 15 small or 4 large. You may send us a custom logo (send to sales@trophycentral.co"]'),
('awin-trophycentral-custom-embossers-proof-for-embosser-or-extra-die-plate-80917-41923028504','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Embossers: Proof For Embosser Or Extra Die Plate","10","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923028504&a=2893129&m=80917","If you would like a proof faxed to you prior to processing, please enter your fax # below."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-custom-flannel-blankets-80917-41923027486','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Flannel Blankets","27.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027486&a=2893129&m=80917","The best blanket in the business! The durable 2 ply construction features our own 100% cotton double brushed European flannel on the front face and cozy 7 oz. fleece on the back. Pefectly sized at 50\" x 60\" for indoor snuggling or outdoor recreation.Not what you want? Click here for related items."]'),
