('awin-trophycentral-custom-frosted-flute-80917-41923027055','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Frosted Flute","4.75","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027055&a=2893129&m=80917",". Price includes one color imprint and setup! Multi-color imprints also available - please call for pricing. Please send camera ready artwork (Illustrator 10, Freehand 9 & Photoshop 5.5) to sales@trophycentral.com."]'),
