('awin-trophycentral-custom-grocery-shopping-bags-first-time-setup-charge-80917-41923027471','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Custom Grocery Shopping Bags: First-time Setup Charge","2","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027471&a=2893129&m=80917","In order to print first-time orders, a die plate must be created. The charge is based on the height x length of the artwork, each rounded up to the nearest inch x $2.00. The minimum charge is $36.00. For example, for artwork that measures 5\" x 4\" the setup charge would cost $40. Artwork that measures 6 1/2 x 5 would costs $70. Please send camera-ready artwork to sales@trophycentral.com."]'),
