('awin-trophycentral-heart-shaped-glass-ornament-80917-41923027549','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heart Shaped Glass Ornament","14.99","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027549&a=2893129&m=80917","Add a little extra sparkle to someone?s tree with our intricately beveled glass ornaments. Perfect for any décor, these pretty ornaments include a gold ribbon hanger. Add a personal message for a gift they?ll long remember. Each ornament can be personalized with up to three lines of text with up to 15 characters per line. In addition we can engrave the holiday image of your choice below the text engraving. Approximate Size is 4\" x 4\". Not what you want? See other Personalized Ornaments."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-heavy-duty-bottle-80917-41923027675','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heavy Duty Bottle","4.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027675&a=2893129&m=80917","Comes with heavy-duty twist-on cap, this rectangle shape easy-grip water bottle is made of durable Polycarbonate. Size: 24 oz. Imprint Area: 1-1/4?W X 3?H"]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
('awin-trophycentral-hedge-metal-pen-80917-41923024999','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Hedge Metal Pen","4.89","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923024999&a=2893129&m=80917","The Hedge is sure to be an instant classic with it''s smooth design and large imprint area! Laser engraved in silver on barrel. Includes up to 5 lines of text in one-color. Please call us at 1-888-809-8800 for logo pricing or other requirements."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-heirloom-890-display-case-80917-41923027676','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heirloom - 890 Display Case","402.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027676&a=2893129&m=80917","A beautiful way to display your prized trophies and awards in a hardwood frame, wall mounted trophy display case. Sliding safety glass doors and built-in locks are standard. Shown in cordovan finish with white laminate back. Includes three 6\" deep full-length shelves with brackets. Wall mounting kit optional. Measures 36\"L x 30\"H x 8\" D . Item 890. Click here for color samples and general information."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-heirloom-series-display-case-80917-41923027007','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heirloom Series Display Case","424.85","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027007&a=2893129&m=80917","A beautiful way to display your prized trophies and awards in a hardwood frame, wall mounted trophy display case. Sliding safety glass doors and built-in locks are standard. Shown in optional Autumn Oak finish with Mirror Back. Please note that hardwood stains block most of the wood grain, lighter oak stains show more grain. Includes five 6\" deep full-length shelves and white laminate display back. Mounting bracket not included. Measures 36\"L x 30\"H x 8\" D . Item 8903. Guaranteed Lowest Prices O"]'),
('awin-trophycentral-helmet-stackmaster-80917-41923027679','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Helmet Stackmaster","419","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027679&a=2893129&m=80917","This heavy duty portable helmet storage/transportation rack holds up to 56 helmets. Rugged no-tip all-welded steel base has four swivel casters for easy portability. Measures 2''6\"W x 6''3\"H."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-helping-hand-certificate-80917-41923025880','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Helping Hand Certificate","0.32","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923025880&a=2893129&m=80917","These popular and brightly colored stock certificates are sure to be a hit! Titles may be combined for quantity discounts. 11 x 8 1/2 inches. Paper: Text Weight Certificate Paper."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-heritage-891-display-cases-80917-41923027004','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heritage 891 Display Cases","1139","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923027004&a=2893129&m=80917","The traditional good looks and solid construction of the heritage series make these oak and hardwood cases the most popular in the product line. These durable cases offer sliding tempered safety glass doors, built-in lock and levelers. Includes 4 half shelves. Shown in Danish Walnut Hardwood finish (picture also shows optional Cornice/Lighting fixture). Please see below for other options. Please note that hardwood stains block most of the wood grain, lighter oak stains show more grain. Guarantee"]'),
('awin-trophycentral-heritage-display-case-80917-41923031055','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Heritage Display Case","428.45","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923031055&a=2893129&m=80917","A beautiful way to display your prized trophies and awards in a hardwood frame, wall mounted trophy display case. Sliding safety glass doors and built-in locks are standard. Shown in Honey Maple Hardwood Finish with White Back. Please note that hardwood stains block most of the wood grain, lighter oak stains show more grain. Includes one glass shelf (position adjustable) and white laminate display back. Mounting bracket not included. Measures 36\"L x 30\"H x 14\" D . Item 894. Click here for color "]'),
