('awin-trophycentral-personalized-6-x-8-diploma-covers-80917-41923028394','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Personalized 6\" x 8\" Diploma Covers","8.75","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923028394&a=2893129&m=80917","Padded 6\" x 8\" diploma cover personalized with your organizations name! Hinge of diploma cover is on the 8\" side. Minimum order quantity: 50. See our complete selection of Diploma Covers."]'),
